      "preview": {
        "text": "# Freeze the old ledger on Nov 3\nStatus: accepted\n\n## Deciders\nKarol, Priya\n\n## Context\nThe cutover rehearsal showed two write paths into the old ledger.\n\n## Decision\nFreeze the old ledger on Nov 3. All writes go to the new ledger after that day.\n\n## Consequences\n- Finance runs one extra reconciliation.\n- Rollback window closes Nov 10.\n"
